OL,3,GNEWSAThird teen arrested after
OL,4,AHalloween party stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third teenage boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter five teenagers were stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party in Hampshire.
OL,10,FPolice said they were called shortly
OL,11,Fafter 22:30 GMT on Saturday to Park
OL,12,FRoad in Chandler's Ford where an
OL,13,F"unknown group" had gained entry to the
OL,14,Fevent.
OL,16,FTwo boys remain in hospital having
OL,17,Fsuffered serious injuries, with one
OL,18,F17-year-old victim in a
OL,19,Flife-threatening condition. The others
OL,20,Fhave been discharged from hospital.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
